{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263i43P1w4Sl1795420167.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>二手放盤持續消耗。美聯物業青衣城分行聯席區域經理劉俊雄表示該行最新促成青衣偉景花園一個694實呎3房套單位成交，獲外區家庭以550萬元承接。<br/>劉俊雄表示，成交單位為偉景花園2座中層E室，實用面積約694平方呎，屬3房2廁間隔，望樓景觀。單位原本於綠表市場以590萬元放售，獲外區家庭客洽購，議價40萬元後，以550萬元承接，折合實用呎價約7925元。</p><p><br/>資料顯示，原業主於1992年65.95萬元購入上述物業，持貨約34年，帳面大幅獲利約484萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.380805+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:37:31.577386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:29.156009+00:00","content_hash":"c840cac2d07807289511b62b6f4164d23bf160bc058281803469ce0ce2ec6d41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.380805+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}